      "question": "According to Surah An-Nahl, how should one call to the way of Allah?",
      "options": [
        "With wisdom and good counsel",
        "By silence",
        "By force",
        "By mockery"
      ],
      "explication": "The call to Allah is made with wisdom and beautiful preaching, without compulsion or mockery.",
      "source": "Surah An-Nahl (16), verse 125"
    },
